<title>BERMUDA: CRICKET-NZ 204 FOR SIX AT TEA VS SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 204 FOR SIX AT TEA VS SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 204 for six wickets at tea in their second innings against Sri Lanka on the third day of the second test on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 222</p>
<p>Second innings 204 for six (B.Young 62, M.Muralitharan 3-54).</p>
<p>Sri Lanka 170 (R.Mahanama 45, H. Davis 5-63, D. Vettori 4-46).</p>
</text>
